    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A collaboration between the  Geneva Centre of Humanitarian Studies , the  Aga Khan University , and the  InternationalCommittee of the Red Cross has led to the development of a new, open-access, online course entitled OperationalResearch for Humanitarians. This unique partnership brings together a vast combination of knowledge, skills andtools.Thecourselaunchingon18October2022,offersacademicexpertise,illustratedbyoperationalandhumanitarianexamples.",
